{"id": "DfQ-bOkR1m-", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Ghar ka sabse chhota… aur kandhon pe poore ghar ki gathri 🤍\n\nChhotu ke paas ek hi roti thi. Usne do tukde kiye, aur bada wala raste ke ek pille ko de diya.\nGhar yaad aaya, door sadak pe ghar dikha bhi. Papa ne haath uthaya, bulane ke liye… phir ishaare se kaha, aage badh.\nRaat flyover ke neeche, khaali pet so gaya.\nPhir toofan aaya. Gathri khul gayi, Didi ki chunni hawa mein udne lagi, aur usne pakad li. Sab samet ke phir baandha… par kone kabhi milte hi nahi.\n\nAur jab aasmaan ne uski kismat likhi, wo kalam hi toot gayi. Ek taara gira.\nUsne aankhein band ki, haath jode… aur wish apne liye nahi, unke liye maangi.\n\n🎵 Long Way from Home · @wickedsunnyyyyy @mcsquare7000 @radhiwaves MC Square ft. Radhika Bhide (prod. Wicked Sunny)\n\nUs bhai ko bhejo jo poore ghar ka bojh chup chaap utha ke chalta hai 🤍\n\n#LongWayFromHome #MCSquare #HindiRap", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793678584, "like_count": 155809, "comment_count": 707, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1924044655642705a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 72.144, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNdnWwMLg0divXd1NvqZrATVBW5uWhHc8n5YRK0G1bFTsTDhfMzORr_NI8Diy0_RyNPZHVVTVIxEhUx3yu7Myx1ol1nod0-bVP6Fos.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdpViGHVDlwkzdSAqutqbpx_vK82eDywVB2dU_750goKTadmL2ewTBFGe4cF0HoN_feHZWYlQa0g0OvHKooWpjHJ&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=YC1s46oHWcsQ7kNvwEmGR5j&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xlKa8GvOlgM0D3jK5yq